--
-- WHAT THE DECREE DOES NOT SAY: no deadline for paying the compensation itself (only for the
-- advance), and no time-bar for claiming. Both fall to the Law on Insurance Business (Article
-- 4(10)); LAW forks L1 and L2 in NOTES.md quote it. Neither is encoded here.

§ `Article 12 — the principles of compensation`

