@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(3)(a)-(b)
GIVEN `the accident has been found within the scope of compensation` IS A BOOLEAN
      harm                                                           IS A `The harm, as estimated for the advance`
      `the estimated compensation for the person`                    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The advance under Article 12(3)`
`Article 12(3) — the advance for` `the accident has been found within the scope of compensation` harm `on an estimated compensation of` `the estimated compensation for the person` MEANS
    IF   `the accident has been found within the scope of compensation`
    THEN CONSIDER harm
         WHEN `death`                                                THEN `an advance of` (`the estimated compensation for the person` TIMES 70%)
         WHEN `a brain injury leaving a persistent vegetative state` THEN `an advance of` (`the estimated compensation for the person` TIMES 50%)
         WHEN `a partial injury` r                                   THEN `an advance of` (`the estimated compensation for the person` TIMES 50%)
    ELSE CONSIDER harm
         WHEN `death`                                                THEN `an advance of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit for health and life, per person per accident` TIMES 30%)
         WHEN `a brain injury leaving a persistent vegetative state` THEN `an advance of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit for health and life, per person per accident` TIMES 30%)
         WHEN `a partial injury` r                                   THEN
             BRANCH IF r AT LEAST 81 THEN `an advance of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit for health and life, per person per accident` TIMES 30%)
                    IF r AT LEAST 31 THEN `an advance of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit for health and life, per person per accident` TIMES 10%)
                    OTHERWISE             `none of the cases Article 12(3) lists`

-- After advancing, the insurer may ask the Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund to repay the advance if
-- the accident is found to be excluded or outside the scope. Article 12(3) gives that right for
-- any advance; Article 17(1)(a), which binds the Fund, repays only an advance under point (b)
-- (finding R10). The Fund is Chapter II Section 2, outside this row.
