§§ `Article 12(5) — who is paid`

-- The insurer pays the insured what the insured has paid or must pay the injured person, within
-- the limit. If the insured has died or lost civil capacity by a court decision, it pays the
-- injured person directly (or the heir of one who has died, or the representative of one who
-- has lost civil capacity or is a minor).
