§§ `Article 12(6)(a) — the compensation for health and life`

-- The amount for each kind of injury is that of Annex VI, or an agreement (if any) between the
-- insured and the injured person (or heir or representative), but not above the Annex VI amount;
-- where a court has decided, the court's figure, but not above the Annex VI amount.
