-- An accident an authority finds caused ENTIRELY by the fault of a third party: the persons who
-- are third parties get 50% of the Annex VI amount, or an agreement not above that 50%. The text
-- keys the halving on "lỗi hoàn toàn của người thứ ba", not on the injured person's own fault, so
-- an innocent third party injured in an accident another third party caused is halved too
-- (finding R4). Fork F18: a court's figure is held to the same 50% ceiling.
