GIVEN v IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`Article 12(6)(a) — the compensation for the health and life of` v p a MEANS
    IF   a's `the owner's share of the fault` LESS THAN 0 OR a's `the owner's share of the fault` GREATER THAN 1
    THEN LEFT `a share of fault is not between 0 and 1`
    ELSE CONSIDER `the Annex VI amount for` p
         WHEN LEFT problem THEN LEFT problem
         WHEN RIGHT `the Annex VI amount` THEN
             RIGHT (`Article 12(8) — the compensation within the limit`
                        (`by the owner's fault` (`as agreed or decided, up to` (`the ceiling` `the Annex VI amount`)))
                        `Article 6(1) — the limit for health and life, per person per accident`)
    WHERE
        `the ceiling` x MEANS
            IF       a's `an authority found it caused entirely by the fault of a third party`
                 AND `Article 3(5)(a) — a third party` v p a
            THEN x TIMES 50%
            ELSE x
        `as agreed or decided, up to` ceiling MEANS
            CONSIDER p's `amount fixed by a court decision for health and life`
            WHEN JUST court THEN min court ceiling
            WHEN NOTHING    THEN
                CONSIDER p's `amount agreed with the insured for health and life`
                WHEN JUST agreed THEN min agreed ceiling
                WHEN NOTHING     THEN ceiling
        `by the owner's fault` x MEANS
            IF   a's `several motor vehicles caused it`
            THEN x TIMES a's `the owner's share of the fault`
            ELSE x

-- The same for a contract, and only where Article 7 covers the harm: where it does not, nothing is
-- payable, and `the answer on cover under the contract for the health and life of` says why.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Articles 7, 12(6)(a); Article 76(1); Decree 220/2026 Article 10(2)
GIVEN c IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
      p IS A `A person harmed in the accident`
      a IS AN `An accident`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`the compensation under the contract for the health and life of` c p a MEANS
    CONSIDER `the rules that govern` c
    WHEN `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023` THEN `a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023 is governed by earlier rules not encoded in this model`
    WHEN `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` v THEN
        IF   `Article 7 — the answer on cover for the health and life of` v p a (c's `the vehicle`) EQUALS `covered`
        THEN `Article 12(6)(a) — the compensation for the health and life of` v p a
        ELSE RIGHT 0

§§ `Article 12(6)(b) — the compensation for property`

-- The actual damage, by the degree of the owner's fault, not above the Article 6(2) limit for the
-- accident. Only the items Article 7 covers count. Fork F17 again: the owner's share of the fault
-- multiplies the damage. The limit is per accident: every person's property counts towards it.
